<title>USA: Kennedy-Wilson sets stock repurchase.</title>
<headline>Kennedy-Wilson sets stock repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kennedy-Wilson Inc said Thursday its board had approved a repurchase program covering up to 50,000 shares of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>Purchases may be made in open market or block transactions through November 30, it said.</p>
<p>The company currently has 1.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
